    "name": {
      "value": "Moderate Goo Grenade"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "loil"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "A goo grenade is a flask filled with a fast-growing, short-lived alchemical ooze. When you hit a creature with a goo grenade, that creature takes persistent acid damage and a circumstance penalty to its Speeds from the clinging goo. The target can end any penalties, conditions, and persistent damage caused by the bomb by Escaping or spending a total of 3 Interact actions to pry themselves free of the ooze. These Interact actions don't have to be consecutive, and other creatures can provide the actions as well. You gain a +1 item bonus to attack rolls. The target takes 2d4 acid damage, 2 persistent acid damage, and 2 acid splash damage. They take a \u20135-foot circumstance penalty to their Speeds. The Escape DC is 17."
    },
